cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SYMFLUENCE in your research, please cite it using the metadata
  below, alongside the companion papers (Eythorsson et al., 2026a,b,c;
  Water Resources Research).
title: >-
  SYMFLUENCE: SYnergistic Modelling Framework for Linking and Unifying
  Earth-system Nexii for Computational Exploration
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
